# Phyrexian Unlife keeps its controller in only for having 0 or less life (CR 104.3d, 704.5c; the 2011-06-01 ruling).
# Bot1 begins at 1 life with nine poison counters; Bot2's first Bolt takes Bot1 to -2 (life loss, no poison), and its second
# is dealt as though it had infect: three more poison counters, twelve, and Bot1 loses to them - not to its life total.

